<title>UK: Whitbread annual profits up 12 perecnt.</title>
<headline>Whitbread annual profits up 12 perecnt.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 1, 1997</p>
<p>			  (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		48.78		  vs 43.25</p>
<p> Total Dividend (pence) 23.80		  vs 21.85</p>
<p> Gearing		    35.1 pct	     vs 22.2</p>
<p> Pretax, pre-excepts    316.5		  vs 283.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   3.027 bln	    vs 2.75 bln</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 313 and 321 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Whitbread Plc</p>
</text>
